# Entity repos

Do not merge Tage, Recruit 619, Signent, or Instant NDA into one git repo or one Vercel project. This OS is the holding-company spine. Subsidiary portals are separate Next apps.

- Cross-entity data: `entity_id` + HTTPS. Never import another company's portal.
- Marketing sites stay in their own repos and POST only to their own OS.
- Sale unit and map: `docs/ENTITY_REPO_ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/ENTITY_SALE_CHECKLIST.md`.
- Signent local OS path is `signenthr-portal`, not `signent-hr-portal`.
